    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "1TH",
      "chapter": 5,
      "chapter_usfm": "1TH.5",
      "version_id": 4669,
      "version_abbr": "AFINT",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Now concerning the times and the seasons, brothers, you have no need for anything to be written to you."
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For you yourselves know accurately that the day of the Lord is coming like a thief in the night."
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "When they say “Peace and security,” then unexpected devastation will come upon them like labour pains upon a pregnant woman,* and they will certainly not escape."
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But you, brothers, are not in darkness, so that the day should overtake you like a thief,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "for all of you are sons of light and sons of day. We are not of night nor of darkness."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "So then, let us not sleep as the rest do,* but let us be watchful and be sober."
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For those who sleep, sleep at night, and those who become intoxicated, are intoxicated at night."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But because we are of the day, let us be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love, and as a helmet, the hope of salvation."
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For God has not appointed us for wrath, but for obtaining salvation through our Lord Jesus Christ,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "who died for us, so that whether we are awake or asleep, we might live together with Him."
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Therefore, exhort one another and build up one another, just as you are also doing."
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.12",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Now we ask you, brothers, to recognise those who labour among you, and who lead you in the Lord, and who admonish you,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.13",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and to regard them very highly in love because of their work. Be at peace among yourselves."
        },
        {
          "verse": 14,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.14",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And we exhort you, brothers, admonish the disorderly, encourage the fainthearted, help the weak, be patient towards all people."
        },
        {
          "verse": 15,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.15",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "See to it that no one repays evil with evil to anyone, but always pursue that which is good for one another and for all people."
        },
        {
          "verse": 16,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.16",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Rejoice always,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 17,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.17",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "pray without ceasing,*"
        },
        {
          "verse": 18,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.18",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "give thanks in everything; for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus for you."
        },
        {
          "verse": 19,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.19",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Do not quench the Spirit."
        },
        {
          "verse": 20,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.20",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Do not despise prophecies,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 21,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.21",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "but test all things; hold fast to that which is good."
        },
        {
          "verse": 22,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.22",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Deliberately refrain from every form of evil."
        },
        {
          "verse": 23,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.23",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify you completely, and may your spirit and soul and body be preserved complete, blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ."
        },
        {
          "verse": 24,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.24",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Faithful is the One who calls you, who also will do it."
        },
        {
          "verse": 25,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.25",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Brothers, pray for us."
        },
        {
          "verse": 26,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.26",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Greet all the brothers with a holy kiss."
        },
        {
          "verse": 27,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.27",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "I put you under oath* by the Lord to have this letter read to all the* brothers."
        },
        {
          "verse": 28,
          "usfm": "1TH.5.28",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you.* 3 Greek like the labour pains upon the one who has a womb 6 The base verb do is contextually supplied for clarity 17 Or continually/constantly 27 Or I solemnly charge you 27 Some ancient manuscripts insert the word holy at this point 28 Some ancient manuscripts insert Amen at the end of the letter"
        }
      ],
